1. Definitions

  "You" (or "Your") means an individual or Legal Entity exercising rights
  under this License.

  "Legal Entity" means the entity using the Licensed Work together with all
  other entities that control, are controlled by, or are under common control
  with that entity. For this definition, "control" means (a) the power,
  direct or indirect, to cause the direction or management of such entity,
  whether by contract or otherwise, or (b) ownership of fifty percent (50%)
  or more of the outstanding shares or beneficial interest of such entity.

  "Annual Gross Revenue" means the aggregate worldwide gross revenue of a
  Legal Entity during its most recently completed fiscal year, from all
  sources, before deduction of expenses, taxes, or other costs, measured in
  United States dollars (USD). If the Legal Entity does not have a completed
  fiscal year, Annual Gross Revenue is the Legal Entity's projected or
  annualized gross revenue.

  "Qualifying User" means:
    (a) an individual using the Licensed Work for personal, hobby, educational,
        research, or evaluation purposes;
    (b) an internal development team of a Legal Entity; or
    (c) a Legal Entity whose Annual Gross Revenue is less than or equal to
        one million United States dollars (USD $1,000,000).

  "Enterprise User" means a Legal Entity whose Annual Gross Revenue exceeds
  one million United States dollars (USD $1,000,000).

  "Managed Service" means offering the Licensed Work, or a substantial
  portion of its functionality, to third parties as a paid hosted, cloud,
  platform, or managed service, including any offering in which third parties
  interact with a running instance of the Licensed Work that You operate.

  "Commercial License" means a separate, written license agreement purchased
  from the Licensor that grants production and other rights beyond those
  provided by this License.


2. Grant of Rights to Qualifying Users

  Subject to the terms of this License, the Licensor hereby grants You a
  worldwide, royalty-free, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable
