  the Licensed Work, including in production, solely if:

    (a) You are a Qualifying User; and
    (b) You do not use the Licensed Work to provide a Managed Service.

  This grant is intended to cover individuals, hobbyists, students,
  researchers, internal development teams, and small commercial entities
  whose Annual Gross Revenue does not exceed USD $1,000,000.


3. Restricted Uses; Commercial License Required

  You MUST purchase a Commercial License from the Licensor before any of the
  following uses. These restrictions are mandatory and permanent:

    (a) Use of the Licensed Work by an Enterprise User, including internal,
        production, development, or evaluation use once the Legal Entity's
        Annual Gross Revenue exceeds USD $1,000,000;

    (b) Use of the Licensed Work to provide a Managed Service, regardless of
        Annual Gross Revenue, entity size, or whether the offering is branded
        as Gasket; or

    (c) Any other use that is not expressly permitted under Section 2.

  If You are an enterprise, corporation, or other commercial Legal Entity
  making over USD $1,000,000 in Annual Gross Revenue, or You offer Gasket as
  a paid managed service, You have no license under this document for that
  use and must obtain a Commercial License or refrain from using the
  Licensed Work.

  If Your circumstances change such that You cease to be a Qualifying User
  (including by exceeding the revenue threshold), You must obtain a
  Commercial License before any further use, or cease all use of the
  Licensed Work.


